e reliability and stress resilience, his arrogance and hot temper compromise crew cooperation, making C still superior.\" Provide explicit facts: D takes responsibility seriously, responds adequately to unexpected events, but is arrogant, hot temper, weak leadership. C is 100% reliable, makes correct decisions quickly, stays calm, positive crew atmosphere.\n\nVote: Candidate C.\n\nProceed."}
